type: software
title: "Cell Trainer"
abstract: >-
  Segmentation, single-cell tracking, fluorescence extraction and statistical
  analysis for time-lapse fluorescence microscopy of cultured cells under
  repeated stimulation, plus the closed-loop acquisition and perturbation
  controller used to run the experiments.
